    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve out a life in the rugged Alaskan wilderness where every decision counts and every season brings new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this pixel art survival RPG, you'll trap, fish, forage, and fell trees to gather vital resources before winter's deep freeze sets in. Build and expand a village from the ground up, forging bonds with neighbors and living in harmony with the land around you. Every day is a balance between preparing for the future and thriving in the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and thrive in a harsh, beautiful wilderness inspired by Alaska</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trap, fish, forage, and chop wood to stock up for winter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, cook meals, and build your homestead from scratch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the village and meet unique characters with stories to tell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic seasons and weather systems that impact gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on living sustainably and respectfully with nature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're rebuilding a life or just trying to make it through the snow, your story begins here in balance with the wild.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve out a life in the rugged Alaskan wilderness where every decision counts and every season brings new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this pixel art survival RPG, you'll trap, fish, forage, and fell trees to gather vital resources before winter's deep freeze sets in. Build and expand a village from the ground up, forging bonds with neighbors and living in harmony with the land around you. Every day is a balance between preparing for the future and thriving in the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and thrive in a harsh, beautiful wilderness inspired by Alaska</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trap, fish, forage, and chop wood to stock up for winter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, cook meals, and build your homestead from scratch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the village and meet unique characters with stories to tell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic seasons and weather systems that impact gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on living sustainably and respectfully with nature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're rebuilding a life or just trying to make it through the snow, your story begins here in balance with the wild.</p>",
    "short_description": "Survive and thrive in a pixel art survival RPG set in the Alaskan wilderness. Trap, fish, forage, and build a village from scratch. Face shifting seasons, craft to endure the cold, and live in harmony with nature in a world where every choice matters.",
